msgstr "全部设备"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Connection"
msgstr "连接方式"

msgid "Daily (90 days)"
msgstr "每日（90天）"

msgid "Daily and monthly usage aggregated from the zen-traffic SQLite database. download = rx, upload = tx."
msgstr "查看设备每日和每月的上传、下载流量。"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "详情"

msgid "Device"
msgstr "设备"

msgid "Device Traffic"
msgstr "设备流量"

msgid "Device: "
msgstr "设备："

msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

msgid "Download rate"
msgstr "下载速率"

msgid "Download ↓"
msgstr "下载 ↓"

msgid "Edit hostname"
msgstr "修改主机名"

msgid "Failed to reset: %s"
msgstr "重置失败：%s"

msgid "Failed to set hostname: %s"
msgstr "修改主机名失败：%s"

msgid "IP"
msgstr "IP 地址"

msgid "Last activity"
msgstr "最后活动时间"

msgid "Monthly (12 months)"
msgstr "每月（12个月）"

msgid "No history data yet. Usage accumulates as traffic flows and is persisted on checkpoint/day rollover."
msgstr "暂无历史数据。有流量后会开始累计，并在定期保存或跨日时写入历史记录。"

msgid "Realtime per-device traffic collected by zen-trafficd (eBPF). rx = download, tx = upload. LAN-local traffic is counted per device but does not inflate Internet usage totals."
msgstr "查看每台设备的实时上传、下载速率。局域网内的流量单独统计，不计入互联网流量总量。"

msgid "Reset all counters for %s?"
msgstr "确定重置 %s 的全部流量统计？"

msgid "Reset counters"
msgstr "重置统计"

msgid "Router"
msgstr "路由器"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "The zen-traffic daemon is not reachable. History is stored in the daemon-side SQLite database."
msgstr "无法连接流量统计服务，请检查服务是否已启动。历史记录保存在该服务的数据库中。"

msgid "The zen-traffic daemon is not reachable. Install/enable the zen-traffic package, then verify with \"ubus call zen.traffic getStatus\" on the device."
msgstr "无法连接流量统计服务。请安装并启用 zen-traffic，然后在路由器上执行“ubus call zen.traffic getStatus”检查状态。"

